{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他仍对当初忍下的气感到不服气，但已经争得没了力气，如今也不在那些人身边了。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"不服气、疲惫、难受、失落\",\n      \"missed\": \"音乐从亲近柔和转向克制的感觉；这件事不能就这样算了的愤怒和自我维护；旧日记忆重新有了温度，可能牵涉某个人或故乡。右上角两条关于心里空了、想念与现实刺痛的提示也不容易一眼读到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他对过去的事情仍有不甘，但已经没有力气继续争辩，意识到自己如今已不在那些人身边，只觉得难受。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"不甘、疲惫、孤独、难受\",\n      \"missed\": \"上方关于旧日记忆、愤怒和眷恋的具体关系仍需要细读。新增的音乐描写中，快速音型逐渐放慢、变稀，最后只剩缓慢和弦，像脚下地板突然消失、只剩一个声音自己说话，这层孤独感与人物处境的对应不容易一眼抓到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他已经从过去的不服气和争辩中逐渐耗尽力气，离开了那些人，剩下的更多是难受和失落。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"疲惫、难受、失落、不甘渐淡\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的躁动和不安加深、144–147像深呼吸或深叹、紧绷短暂松开等细节，需要逐句读才能理解；尤其最后的短暂松弛并不是释怀，而更像抵抗累了，这层情绪区别不容易扫到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"两条大字已经能把过去的不服气和如今的疲惫、难受串起来，人物主线是清楚的。最影响整体串联的是中小字号文字：音乐变化、事件态度、愤怒悲伤、旧日记忆和具体意象连续并排，彼此之间的归属关系不够一眼明示。读者能分别扫到这些词，却不一定马上知道它们如何共同构成这个人的情绪变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "578e4bb6-dc3f-4542-b9ea-78749f64ed4d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T003756200520Z", "elapsed_seconds": 58.391, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:38:54.595494+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "03d9597ec428ff7aa078234b345af616b2e685458572a83e1fac26ceefb17b01", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T003756200520Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "302176fc3c0b04c87041b156f22de32dc8be43d909a039b9c4c0da58b894d4bf"}}}
